{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46193","headline":"山居诗二十四首 七 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慵甚嵇康竟不回，何妨方寸似寒灰。\n山精日作儿童出，仙者时将玉器来。\n筠帚埽花惊睡鹿，地垆烧树带枯苔。\n不行朝市多时也，许史金张安在哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}